 * @notice Base contract for YieldFi v3 contracts, providing access control, identity, and versioning
 * @dev Provides role-based access control, reentrancy protection, and protocol identity validation
 * @dev Security: If administrator is not set, paused() and isBlacklisted() return true to stop contract operations
 *      rather than allowing unrestricted access. This ensures contracts are secure by default.
